					%3$sYou will receive the full payment minus the applicable PayPal fee. See %1$sterms and conditions%2$s.%4$s'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Enable Installments'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Accept PayPal, Pay Later and alternative payment types.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'We\'ve redesigned the settings for better performance and usability. Starting late January, this improved design will be the default for all WooCommerce installations to enjoy faster navigation, cleaner organization, and improved performance. Check out the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Startup Guide</a>, then click <a href="#" name="settings-switch-ui"><strong>Switch to New Settings</strong></a> to activate it.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'PayPal Working Capital'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Business loans from $1k to $230k for first-time borrowers. Looking to fuel your business growth? With a PayPal Working Capital loan, approved loans are funded in minutes and repaid as a share of your sales. Minimum payment required every 90 days. The lender for PayPal Working Capital is WebBank.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Learn More'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'📢 Important: New PayPal Payments settings UI becoming default in January!'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Switch to New Settings'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Fraud protection is now required — enable today'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Card networks like Visa, Mastercard and American Express now require fraud prevention controls, and non-compliance may result in fines and processing restrictions. Please enable reCAPTCHA in your PayPal Payments settings to help protect your store and maintain compliance.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Enable reCAPTCHA →'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Learn more'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Our all-in-one checkout solution lets you offer PayPal, Venmo, Pay Later options, and more to help maximize conversion.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Venmo'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Offer Venmo at checkout to millions of active users.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Get paid in full at checkout while giving your customers the flexibility to pay in installments over time with no late fees.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Credit and debit card payments'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Accept all major credit and debit cards - even if your customer doesn\'t have a PayPal account . '=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Present custom credit and debit card fields to your payers so they can pay with credit and debit cards using your site\'s branding.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Display cardholder name'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Fastlane by PayPal'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Tap into the scale and trust of PayPal\'s customer network to recognize shoppers and make guest checkout more seamless than ever.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Display Fastlane Watermark'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Allow customers to pay via their Apple Pay digital wallet.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Allow customers to pay via their Google Pay digital wallet.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Pay with Crypto'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Accept cryptocurrency payments through PayPal, which supports various digital currencies. Receive USD payments in your PayPal balance.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Bancontact'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Bancontact is the most widely used, accepted and trusted electronic payment method in Belgium. Bancontact makes it possible to pay directly through the online payment systems of all major Belgian banks.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'BLIK'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'A widely used mobile payment method in Poland, allowing Polish customers to pay directly via their banking apps. Transactions are processed in PLN.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'eps'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'An online payment method in Austria, enabling Austrian buyers to make secure payments directly through their bank accounts. Transactions are processed in EUR.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'iDEAL'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'iDEAL is a payment method in the Netherlands that allows buyers to select their issuing bank from a list of options.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'MyBank'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'A European online banking payment solution primarily used in Italy, enabling customers to make secure bank transfers during checkout. Transactions are processed in EUR.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Przelewy24'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'A popular online payment gateway in Poland, offering various payment options for Polish customers. Transactions can be processed in PLN or EUR.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Trustly'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'A European payment method that allows buyers to make payments directly from their bank accounts, suitable for customers across multiple European countries. Supported currencies include EUR, DKK, SEK, GBP, and NOK.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Multibanco'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'An online payment method in Portugal, enabling Portuguese buyers to make secure payments directly through their bank accounts. Transactions are processed in EUR.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'OXXO'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'OXXO is a Mexican chain of convenience stores. *Get PayPal account permission to use OXXO payment functionality by contacting us at (+52) 800–925–0304'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Checkout page title'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Checkout page description'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Show logo'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Advanced Credit and Debit Card Payments'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Pay upon Invoice'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]],'Pay upon Invoice is an invoice payment method in Germany. It is a local buy now, pay later payment method that allows the buyer to place an order, receive the goods, try them, verify they are in good order, and then pay the invoice within 30 days.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['woocommerce-paypal-payments',1]]]];
